q(12,13,'Fresh-air load','Dry-air intake is 0.10 kg/s and outside-to-inside moist-air enthalpy difference is 30 kJ/kg dry air. Find fresh-air refrigeration load.',3,'kW','Use a dry-air mass-flow basis for the supplied moist-air enthalpies.', ['Pfresh = ṁda(hout−hin)','Pfresh = 0.10×30'],S('book-c12-p180-r02',{'ṁ_da':.1,h_out:50,h_in:20}));
q(12,14,'Product freezing energy','Cool 100 kg of a product from 10 °C to −10 °C with freezing temperature 0 °C, cabove=3 kJ/(kg·K), cbelow=2 kJ/(kg·K), water mass fraction 0.8 and latent heat 334 kJ/kg water. Find total removed heat in MJ.',31.72,'MJ','Include sensible cooling above freezing, water latent heat, and sensible cooling below.', ['Q = 100[3×10 + 0.8×334 + 2×10] kJ','Q = 31720 kJ = 31.72 MJ'],S('book-c12-p180-r03',{m:100,c_above:3,'T₁':10,T_f:0,w_water:.8,L_f:334,c_below:2,'T₂':-10},{outputScale:.001}));
q(12,15,'Combined room load','A stated room load consists of product cooling 5 kW, respiration 0.5 kW, fresh air 3 kW, fans 0.2 kW and lighting 0.3 kW. Find total cooling duty before design margin.',9,'kW','Add all loads once; no unstated safety margin is requested.', ['Q̇L = Pproduct+Presp+Pfresh+Pfan+Plight','Q̇L = 5+0.5+3+0.2+0.3'],S('book-c12-p180-r05',{P_product:5,P_resp:.5,P_fresh:3,P_fan:.2,P_light:.3}));
q(12,16,'Cycle energy balance','A steady refrigerant cycle has flow 0.2 kg/s, h₁=400, h₂=450 and h₃=h₄=250 kJ/kg. Neglect external losses. Find condenser heat rejection.',40,'kW','Condenser rejection equals evaporator cooling plus compressor input.', ['Q̇L = 0.2(400−250)=30 kW; Ẇ=0.2(450−400)=10 kW','Q̇H = 30+10 = 0.2(450−250)'],F('cycleRejection',{flow:.2,h1:400,h2:450,h3:250}));
